 ### [Neural SDF and Material MLPs](10268-neural-sdf-and-material-mlps.md)
-This method uses distinct MLPs for SDF and material properties (diffuse/specular albedo, roughness) within the IRON pipeline, addressing spectral bias via positional encoding. It differs from TensoRF Feature Decoding by using explicit separate MLPs rather than tensor-decoded features, and from Neural Surface Rendering by focusing on specific architectural hyperparameters for inverse rendering.
