 ### [Reflectance NeRF](14040-reflectance-nerf.md)
-Reflectance NeRF predicts per-channel reflectance modification factors conditioned on position, view direction, lighting direction, and base albedo, extending standard NeRF to model view-dependent and light-dependent reflectance. It builds on Neural BRDF and Geometry Decoding by providing a specific implementation for decoding appearance features into reflectance multipliers.
